{
  "name": "[RVT-IN] [RL_0031] High Sum and Velocity of Round Transactions | Inbound",
  "description": "The customer {{Sum_of_Round_Inbound_Transactions}} {{Base_Currency}} sum of round inbound transactions, received in {{Number_of_Round_Inbound_Transactions}} separate payments over the last 30 days, has exceeded the set number and sum of round inbound transaction limits. \n\n[A transaction was considered round if it was a multiple of 1,000 in the original transaction currency.]",
